cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its reports, please cite it as below. Please also
  cite the UCI Heart Disease data set listed under references.
type: software
title: "Medical Risk Modeling Lab"
abstract: >-
  Development and internal-external evaluation of a clinical prediction model
  for angiographic coronary artery disease in patients referred for coronary
  angiography, using the UCI Heart Disease (Cleveland) data, reported following
  TRIPOD+AI. Research and education only; not a clinical tool.
authors:
